00:15:39.000 --> 00:16:14.000
And we said, well, how can you not have theory? I mean, how do you know what to do? And they said, well, we just do what we always did. That there are traditions and making ads of certain types, and we just keep right on doing it. Because we don't see any alternatives. And so when we ask them, for example, when you make a television ad, do you test it to see the impact that it has, the way a scientist would. Oh, no, definitely we don't do that. You know, why not? Well, because we don't have time and we don't have money. And so when we academics evaluate the impact of ads, what we find
总的来说，来自许多不同类型研究的观点是，我可以告诉您关于一个人的五件好事，但如果我告诉您关于那个人的这一件坏事，它会不成比例地影响您对那个人的印象。所以您可能会认为专注于抹黑是有道理的。问题在于，这些攻击性广告中有太多需要编造一些被夸大得令人恐惧的故事，并且以我所说的“鲨鱼鳍音乐”、黑暗图像和阴森的声音呈现，我想我们大家都对它们感到厌倦了。

